<Item XName="Flexible OFDM MIMO Connected Solution" UserName="Flexible OFDM MIMO Connected Solution" Type="Notes">
<Description>Example text with pretty printing</Description>
<LibName>Eagleware</LibName>
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>&lt;P class=MsoTitle style=&quot;BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 0.75pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1pt; PADDING-TOP: 0in; PADDING-LEFT: 0in; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 0in&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=5 face=Arial&gt;Flexible&amp;nbsp;OFDM MIMO Connected Solution&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt&quot; align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;Keysight Technologies SystemVue &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt&quot;&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;This example workspace demontrates the connected solution with flexible OFDM MIMO 2x2 system and MIMO 2x8 system.&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = &quot;o&quot; ns = &quot;urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office&quot; /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;For OFDM MIMO 2x2 system&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x00B7;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In transmitter side, three different signal generators are supported.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .75in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x00B7;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;ESG/MXG &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .75in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x00B7;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;M9381A&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .75in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x00B7;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;M8190A&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.25in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Note for ESG/MXG, users need to run &lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;MXG_MIMO_Download&lt;/B&gt; equation to turn on the signals.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x00B7;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In receiver side, a VSA 89600B source model is used to capture multi-channel signals from the hardware.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x00B7;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Also a reference design FlexOFDM_MIMO_2x2_BER is provided for pure &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;A name=OLE_LINK4&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;A name=OLE_LINK3&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-bookmark: OLE_LINK4&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;software &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/A&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;BER simulation.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;For OFDM MIMO 2x8 system&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraph style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x00B7;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In transmitter side, one signal generator is supported for high bandwidth signal.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.75in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .75in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x00B7;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;M8190A&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x00B7;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;In receiver side, a VSA 89600B source model is used to capture multi-channel signals from the hardware, e.g. M9703A. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoListParagraphCxSpLast style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-INDENT: -0.25in; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo3&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;mso-list: Ignore&quot;&gt;&#x00B7;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT: 7pt &apos;Times New Roman&apos;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Also a reference design FlexOFDM_MIMO_2x2_BER is provided for pure software BER simulation. In the receiver, a hybrid receiver beamforming structure is employed with 8 receiver antennas and 2 RF chains. The &lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;HBF_Controller_WB&lt;/B&gt; model will calculate the receiver beamforming weights based on received preamble signals to adjust receiver beamforming beams.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 1.2pt 0in; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal&quot;&gt;&lt;B&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Instruction:&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/B&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL type=disc&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Update FlexOFDM parameters in &lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;Equations&lt;/B&gt; Tab of the designs, and get reasonable results in pure software software BER simulation in FlexOFDM_MIMO_2x2_BER or FlexOFDM_MIMO_2x8_BER.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Download signals to signal generators&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL type=circle&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l2 level2 lfo2; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list 1.0in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Activate corresponding models for desired instruments, and deactivate the others. &lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l2 level2 lfo2; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list 1.0in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Set instrument address in models. With the default settings, one frame data is downloaded. For instance, for ESG/MXG, we need to set ESG or MXG, and their IP address, and make sure the instruments are connected correctly as the instructions in the documentation of SignalDownloader_E4438C. Then we can run &lt;B style=&quot;mso-bidi-font-weight: normal&quot;&gt;MXG_MIMO_Download&lt;/B&gt; equation to download the signals. Refer to the documentation of downloader models for detailed parameter settings.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo2; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list .5in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Capture the signals from instruments via VSA 89600 software&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;UL type=circle&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l2 level2 lfo2; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list 1.0in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Before invoking VSA 89600 software in SystemVue, open standalone VSA 89600 software to connect to multi-channel instruments (e.g. scope).&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l2 level2 lfo2; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list 1.0in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;Run FlexOFDM_MIMO_2x2_Rx or FlexOFDM_MIMO_2x8_Rx design, where we can open VSA 89600 GUI to check the signals and set the configurations. Although OFDM MIMO receiver can demodulate the signals captured at any position of frame data, it is suggested that the signals are captured with a trigger from signal generators so that the signals are captured at the beginning of (or ahead of) frame data.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l2 level2 lfo2; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list 1.0in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;With the default setting, the receiver can demodulate one frame data as only one frame data are downloaded.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;LI class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; mso-list: l2 level2 lfo2; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; tab-stops: list 1.0in&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: &apos;Times New Roman&apos;; mso-bidi-font-family: Calibri; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-latin&quot;&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;After the simulation, we can get BER and constellations from captured signals.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/LI&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&lt;/UL&gt;&#x000D;&#x000A;&lt;P class=MsoNormal style=&quot;MARGIN: 0in 0in 10pt&quot;&gt;&lt;SPAN style=&quot;FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 115%&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;FONT face=Calibri&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;</Text>
<Item XName="Page" Type="PageMgr">
